  "dealer_description": "This 2019 Tesla Model 3 Long Range delivers sophisticated electric driving with genuine practicality for today's discerning buyer.\n\n- 15 Speakers with Premium Audio System\n- Dual Motor AWD\n- 120 city / 112 highway MPGe\n- Navigation System\n- Premium Heated Front Bucket Seats\n- Automatic Temperature Control with Front Dual Zone A/C\n- Memory Seat and Steering Wheel Memory\n- Exterior Parking Camera Rear\n- Four-Wheel Independent Suspension\n- Auto-Dimming Rear-View Mirror\n- Fully Automatic Headlights with Auto High-Beam\n- Power Driver and Passenger Seats\n- Heated Front and Rear Seats\n- Split Folding Rear Seat\n- 18\" Aero Alloy Wheels\n\nThe Long Range designation means this Model 3 was engineered for extended driving capability. With dual motors and all-wheel drive, you receive balanced performance and confident handling across varying road conditions. The vehicle's electric propulsion system operates with minimal maintenance compared to traditional engines, contributing to lower long-term ownership costs.\n\nInside, the cabin reflects a premium design philosophy. The genuine wood dashboard insert and premium seat trim create an upscale environment that distinguishes this Model 3 from standard configurations. Premium heated front and rear seats ensure comfort throughout the year, while automatic temperature control with dual front zone capability lets you and your passenger maintain individual climate preferences.\n\nTechnology integration is thoughtfully executed. The navigation system, 15-speaker premium audio, and steering wheel-mounted audio controls provide seamless access to entertainment and guidance without distraction. Memory seat and steering wheel functions retain your preferred driving position automatically, and the auto-dimming rear-view mirror reduces glare during evening and early morning drives.\n\nSafety and visibility receive appropriate attention. Dual front impact airbags, front side impact airbags, knee airbags, and overhead airbags create a comprehensive protection framework. The exterior parking camera rear, fully automatic headlights with auto high-beam capability, and front fog lights contribute to confident operation in diverse lighting and weather conditions. Four-wheel disc brakes with ABS and electronic stability control provide responsive, predictable stopping performance.\n\nThe blue exterior finish presents a striking aesthetic that maintains its visual appeal with proper care. At 55,562 miles, this Model 3 Long Range remains well within the span where owners typically experience peak value and minimal unexpected expenses.\n\nWe invite you to schedule a time to drive this Model 3 Long Range and confirm how its refined features and efficient electric operation align with your driving needs and lifestyle expectations.",
